        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\frac{2}{3}<\\frac{5}{6}<\\frac{7}{8}$",
          "worked": "Use common denominator 24.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{7}{8}&=\\frac{21}{24}\\\\\\frac{2}{3}&=\\frac{16}{24}\\\\\\frac{5}{6}&=\\frac{20}{24}\\end{align*}$$\n\nSince $16<20<21$, the order is $\\frac{2}{3}<\\frac{5}{6}<\\frac{7}{8}$.",
